      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In his office, Barinov answers a frantic phone call from Katya explaining why she let Yulya slip out to the Metropol. Seconds later, a knock sounds on the suite door summoning 'Yulya' to dinner with the sheikh.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
